Signing on behalf of {{SELLER.FULL_NAME}}', 'input', 20, false, NULL, '{"equals": ["ENTITY"], "field_key": "SELLER.PARTY_TYPE"}', NULL, '2026-08-02 14:03:17.130192+00', false);
